{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-04",
  "title": "喧嘩爭端",
  "storyCode": "15-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fd5031d2d693d71cb16829b55b65fef12b84e705c02fb131ca6ed72eb10cf308",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您問我，為什麼與您首次思維共振時分享的言語是“死亡”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也說不上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在這個名為“羅德島”的奇妙巨型艦船裡，卡特斯幾乎無法感知到時間的流逝。\n她為此而焦慮。從她成為感染者的那天起，“時間”對她而言便無比重要。\n時間會為她帶來死亡，也贈與她解脫。\n……但生活在這奇妙的地方卻又否認自己是“神明”的存在們，似乎對此毫不在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是我從來沒有害怕過死去。“死亡”不過只是一種去往新環境的途徑而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（雷姆必拓語）悲觀主義者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的語言是如此描述你的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "悲觀？我並不這麼覺得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯脫口而出，但又有些後悔。她在辯論中認同了許多教士的說法，但來到這裡之後，她還需要如此思考嗎？\n她真的在乎崩解前所經歷的一切嗎？\n畢竟，現在，連時間也已經棄她而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾經在一個永遠走不到盡頭的礦井中工作，工頭為了確保效率，會殺死或驅趕那些令人討厭的源石蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石蟲？礦井？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，源石蟲是某種遠比我還弱小的生物。而礦井……礦井也曾是我的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而工頭沒想到的是，礦井裡最善良的那位工人會偷偷餵養那些被驅趕的源石蟲，這反倒讓更多的源石蟲湧進了礦井……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果牠們破壞了礦井的穩定，大地坍塌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你活了下來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那些源石蟲的分泌物養活了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那樣惡劣的環境裡，牠們中許多個體的生命很短暫，卻不斷有新的個體降生。牠們鼓舞了我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦工、源石蟲，還有你自己——但你的故事中卻無視了“大地的死亡”，希爾達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們並不重視你們的“大地”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並非如此！“大地保佑”在我們的語言中無比神聖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "屈光者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……你們似乎對生命的定義依舊單一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不理解。您引導我見到了許多截然不同的個體……你們同樣有著愛與恨，卻又彼此之間具有如此之大的差異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“在墳墓中打撈死亡”——你們以一個我無法理解的目標生活，團結在一起……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但我為何會來到這裡？\n卡特斯如此想著，但直覺告訴她，答案就在向她伸出手的人那裡。\n她透過艙室頂端的舷窗看向了無垠的冷寂深空。來自遙遠巨大球體的光芒再一次掠過死亡的行星，刺痛著卡特斯的雙眼。\n但模糊中，她從那炫目的光芒裡看到了一個渺小的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深空中……有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——是我要找的那個人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深空中的人似乎聽到了卡特斯的聲音，光芒中的黑影閃動了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自內心響起的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）你在尋找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一圈、兩圈……那些小圓點在一片黑暗中轉動著。\n它們越來越近，越來越快。\n它們將黑暗撕開了一道裂縫，光透過來，那道光明亮，熾熱。\n我伸出手，擁抱它們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中心體溫異常升高，神經阻滯劑已推入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "體溫升高太快了，準備肌肉鬆弛劑，補充血容量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重複給藥，開始手術——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesward"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "華法琳醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我又睡著了嗎……可能因為太睏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要用力說話，你的咽喉也受到了損傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是感覺自己睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，還做了很長的夢呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有感覺到其他的不適？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，沒有。華法琳醫生，剛剛發生了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼大礙，有夢到什麼特別的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特別的東西……說不上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在夢裡，有許多的泥球在黑色的絲絨上繞著彼此轉圈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們忽大忽小，一下子比孩子的彈珠還小，一下子又好像比整個維多利亞還要大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有誰撿起了它們，把它們彈出去……一個撞上另一個，就像煙火一樣炸開了，但是聽不到一點聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……還有呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還看到，一根根線……從一個泥球到另一個，每根線都是由光做成的。每根線上，都有好多人，踩著光向外跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟著他們，跑到一片白色的大地，空蕩蕩的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有一個孤零零的石碑樹立在那裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "石碑？上面有什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼也沒有，華法琳醫生，然後我就醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪的夢，不過你記得很清楚，說明你大腦中的記憶模組還在正常工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夢越清晰，說明做夢的人也快醒了。對我來說，你還能記得自己的夢是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，今天沒有看到Touch醫生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她有其他的任務。你看，她託我把這袋東西交給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些是……發條、齒輪，還有指針……這是製作自鳴鐘的零件！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說是能幫你舒緩精神壓力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……華法琳醫生，羅德島又遇上了可怕的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescorner"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小傢伙，你來錯了地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小嘟嘟”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不出意外地迷路）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小嘟嘟”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（害怕地躲藏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來可露希爾沒有好好檢查你的工作排程模組。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小傢伙，你的維修清單上不該出現這個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌利亞輕輕提起了它，好奇地在手中反覆觀察著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小嘟嘟”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（憤怒地轉動履帶）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "變化真大啊，殿下剛走那時，這裡還空蕩蕩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，已經多了很多有趣的人和事了，對吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓他們不用擔心，能源動力層交給我就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，你從維多利亞回來之後，變得比過往消沉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你手下那些小傢伙呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調去艦外協助建立隔離帶了，本艦有我在足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的確需要一個行走在黑暗中的尖刃，但並不代表你自己需要刻意保持沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時間可以來找我聊聊，我這裡有酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，我也想從你這裡聽聽特雷西斯的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我見證了那段英雄史詩的開端，而你目睹了它的落幕。我們看到的，差距很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的想法，等博士和阿米婭抽出空來，我會代為轉達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌利亞將“小嘟嘟”放到了離開的通道之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂逛了，能源動力層很危險。別以為高濃度的源石環境不會影響你這樣的小傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的工作，有我盯著就足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小嘟嘟”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1726_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（慌張地逃跑）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲鍋爐工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希勛爵，到底是什麼事情能讓你如此緊張？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況不對勁，敵方所配備的武器技術已超越了任務預期，有暴露風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵方可能有電訊號偵測裝置，我先關閉無人機的傳輸功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos，無人機畫面的即時回傳就靠你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已有準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“迴路”。以言語刻錄源石迴路，以筆繪出蜂群所見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos的骨筆懸浮，自動刻錄出無人機所拍攝出的畫面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十二輛被黃沙掩藏的高機動載具、武裝人員三十一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五個狙擊哨位的位置已經標記，營帳內疑似有訊號隔絕裝置，掃描無法穿透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "均攜帶未識別武器，威脅等級不明，需要進一步確認現場情況——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Raidian，接下來交給你接手，我開始準備撤回無人機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就位啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等片刻。你們能看到我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "骨筆輕點，文字編織出一個初具輪廓的人形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raidian正拘謹地向監看著畫面的兩人招手，哪怕是浮動的文字也能清晰地印刻出她的微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以隨時準備策應你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事啦，九十秒，我會和你的無人機一起撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "畫面中，Raidian旁若無人地走進了隔絕了訊號的營帳，通訊被切斷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨時可以強攻，咒言已隨風飄至陣地附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滋——完成，所有情報轉錄完啦，馬上回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒鬧出任何動靜，我覆寫了所有目標大腦接收的視覺電訊號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕在他們眼裡，恰巧有隻調皮的小沙地獸跳進了營帳裡躲避風沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mechanist，如何？解析出來的情報有什麼發現嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有武器都抹除了來源，且都改造過以符合操作者的需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但其操作手法我並不陌生，博士不久前剛與我交流過這種罕見的設計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們來自阿戈爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈爾？但要和我們對接的人不也是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論如何，清理威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可放任如此威脅干擾我們的設備轉運，也不能引發騷動讓轉運的同僚和對接人注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事關重大，需無聲無息解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescorner"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有辦法，對方配備了特殊防護設備來應對我們的物理攻擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島狙擊幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是有預謀的，他們甚至清楚我們的人員配置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭小姐，請靠後，他們顯然是衝著我們的開採模組來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，我就知道又得加班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斑點，支援月見夜和空爆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡普卡，呼叫增援了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯嗯……泡普卡已經呼叫了，\n梓蘭姐姐，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "襲擊者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，只是徒勞。其他人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "襲擊者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪來的聲音？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的確準備了許多，但可惜應對源石技藝的手段還是捉襟見肘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "襲擊者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不對，不該是你們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Touch",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷員我來處理，不過月見夜又變得過於亢奮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Touch",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梓蘭，又得辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會處理好他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士猜得對，有人洩露了我們行動的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快速解決吧，儘快將這艘備用開採艦拖動到最近的移動城市修補能源艙室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後迅速趕回本艦，避免所有意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_281_popka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pith女、女士，為什麼來增援的是你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_281_popka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前PRTS通知的是Misery先生啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨出發前突然更改計劃，我擔心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我信任你們。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Misery、Stormeye、Sharp他們另有安排。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要同步到PRTS上告知同事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不必。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果一切順利，說明我只是多想。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "如果出現意外，以最快速度解決然後回防本艦。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是今天第幾批襲擊我們的傭兵了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第七批。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然威脅性並不高，但近一週來，每天的襲擊都這麼頻繁也太過詭異了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這才剛剛進入卡茲戴爾的邊境範圍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些人不怕死的樣子，讓我想起以前在薩爾貢認識的那些傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毫無信念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Misery怎麼花了這麼長時間？已經過了預計的返程時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要知道，這裡離疤痕商場還是有一些距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕我熟悉這裡的每條捷徑，也得耗費一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調查結果如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近兩週，有人透過層層外包，將疤痕商場的大部分訂單都聚集在了這一片區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "委託人完全查不出來，隱藏得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，我們只是“運氣不好”撞上了這些傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們並非衝著我們而來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士臨出發前的擔憂看來並非全無道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，哨崗有新消息傳回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又有一夥傭兵的行動軌跡開始向我們的位置偏移，極有可能會馬上再次接敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘆氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Misery先生，我感覺情況不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些源源不斷的傭兵似乎並不是想要讓我們造成損失，更像是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sharp",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拖延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以留在這裡繼續護送隊伍前進，各位可以先行返回本艦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別著急，芬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些人的打算並沒有那麼容易得逞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空氣在波動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……起風了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……那是，“生命脊椎”？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蒼穹之上，龐大的骸骨蕩漾著歷史的塵埃顯現，投下了巨大的陰影。\n那是羅德島的許多人第一次親眼目睹這個曾在維多利亞的混亂中出現的巨大骨架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島工程部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_971_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真是壯觀……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調查疤痕商場時，我順便去了趟卡茲戴爾，見了幾位老朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來就交給他們吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們該回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經切斷了周圍可視範圍內所有通訊，直接動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（吹響骨哨）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，他們的武器能克制我的設備，卻對你的骨哨和咒言沒有太多抵抗能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並非如此，他們只是尚不甚瞭解我的言語規則罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對阿戈爾創造如此精妙武器的想法亦有好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我收繳一點回去拆了幫你研究看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個！我們還在執行任務欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面還有至少三支隊伍在埋伏，我們分身乏術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕沒辦法暗中處理乾淨了，必須得通知我們的人準備應對衝擊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂喂喂，博士快遞的支援就位了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Raidian、Mechanist，替我們標記位置，“壞傢伙”號馬上趕過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查看你們的通訊設備，我已經把位置同步給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，迷迭香，不是說好我先跳，替你吸引火力嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會控制好法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我檢查了周邊區域的所有訊號，的確已經全部清除了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，誰能告訴我……這到底是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "損壞的“小幫手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這個東西試圖自毀的時候，可是花了全力砸它才把它停下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我們對接的也是阿戈爾，他們為什麼要襲擊我們的人員和設備？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給凱爾希醫生和博士判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確保人員和設備安全交接到克萊門莎的人手中後，我們立刻返回本艦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些情況必須儘快處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有未知的洩密者，恐怕這只是開端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，PRTS的回應速度變慢了？是我的錯覺嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對不對，讓我再檢查一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PRTS，輸出近兩週的所有後台日誌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，這裡沒有問題……這個也沒有問題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——全都沒有問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_278_orchid",
      "aliases": [
        "梓蘭"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
